      "line": 11,
      "start": 2,
      "end": 42,
      "source_quote": "王秀之字伯奮，琅邪臨沂人也。祖裕，宋左光祿大夫、儀同三司。父瓚之，金紫光祿大夫。",
      "interpretation": "齊書明祖裕、父瓚之，並載里貫。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "sources/nanqishu/nanqishu046-ws1511897.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1511897,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511897",
      "raw_sha256": "d109243a343e069b8ce98cb0607567b69305574aa59ecc8776b9ea70ca0fd537",
      "line": 13,
      "start": 42,
      "end": 63,
      "source_quote": "吏部尚書褚淵見秀之正潔，欲與結婚，秀之不肯",
      "interpretation": "褚淵即南史稱褚彥回。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "sources/nanqishu/nanqishu046-ws1511897.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1511897,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511897",
      "raw_sha256": "d109243a343e069b8ce98cb0607567b69305574aa59ecc8776b9ea70ca0fd537",
      "line": 15,
      "start": 113,
      "end": 127,
      "source_quote": "於荊州立學，以秀之領儒林祭酒",
      "interpretation": "豫章王嶷立學；齊書另詳前後任職。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "sources/nanqishu/nanqishu046-ws1511897.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1511897,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511897",
      "raw_sha256": "d109243a343e069b8ce98cb0607567b69305574aa59ecc8776b9ea70ca0fd537",
      "line": 17,
      "start": 35,
      "end": 54,
      "source_quote": "與子瓚之書曰：「吾欲使汝處不競之地。」",
      "interpretation": "齊書保留瓚之收信的直接引語。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "sources/nanqishu/nanqishu046-ws1511897.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1511897,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511897",
      "raw_sha256": "d109243a343e069b8ce98cb0607567b69305574aa59ecc8776b9ea70ca0fd537",
      "line": 21,
      "start": 88,
      "end": 98,
      "source_quote": "年五十三。謚曰簡子。",
      "interpretation": "齊書明歲數五十三，南史無此數。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "source-evidence/song066-jinghong/external/ws754387.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 754387,
      "url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=754387",
